{
  "category": "Sunne Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It is said to live in another world. The intense light it radiates from the surface of its body can make the darkest of nights light up like midday.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is said to be a male evolution of Cosmog. At the activation of its third eye, it departs for another world.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes the result of its opening an Ultra Wormhole is that energy and life-forms from other worlds are called here to this world.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "In writings from the distant past, it’s called by the name “the beast that devours the sun.”",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "When light radiates from its body, this Pokémon could almost appear to be the sun. It will dispel any darkness and light up the world.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solgaleo was once known as the Beast That Devours the Sun. Energy in the form of light radiates boundlessly from it.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
